| **Feature**         | **C++ `vector`**                       | **Java `ArrayList`**                           | **Python `list`** |
| ------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ----------------- |
| **Name**            | `vector`                               | `ArrayList`                                    | `list`            |
| **Import**          | `#include <vector>`                    | `import java.util.ArrayList;`                  | No import         |
| **Declaration**     | `vector<int> v;`                       | `ArrayList<Integer> list = new ArrayList<>();` | `v = []`          |
| **Dynamic Array**   | ✅                                      | ✅                                              | ✅                 |
| **Add at End**      | `v.push_back(x)` / `v.emplace_back(x)` | `list.add(x)`                                  | `v.append(x)`     |
| **Access**          | `v[index]`                             | `list.get(index)`                              | `v[index]`        |
| **Modify**          | `v[index] = x`                         | `list.set(index, x)`                           | `v[index] = x`    |
| **Insert at Index** | `v.insert(v.begin()+i, x)`             | `list.add(i, x)`                               | `v.insert(i, x)`  |
| **Remove by Index** | `v.erase(v.begin()+i)`                 | `list.remove(i)`                               | `v.pop(i)`        |
| **Remove by Value** | `v.erase(...)`                         | `list.remove(Integer.valueOf(x))`              | `v.remove(x)`     |
| **Remove Last**     | `v.pop_back()`                         | `list.remove(list.size()-1)`                   | `v.pop()`         |
| **Size**            | `v.size()`                             | `list.size()`                                  | `len(v)`          |
| **Clear**           | `v.clear()`                            | `list.clear()`                                 | `v.clear()`       |
| **Empty Check**     | `v.empty()`                            | `list.isEmpty()`                               | `not v`           |
| **First Element**   | `v.front()`                            | `list.get(0)`                                  | `v[0]`            |
| **Last Element**    | `v.back()`                             | `list.get(list.size()-1)`                      | `v[-1]`           |
| **Random Access**   | O(1)                                   | O(1)                                           | O(1)              |
| **Add at End**      | O(1) amortized                         | O(1) amortized                                 | O(1) amortized    |
| **Insert Middle**   | O(n)                                   | O(n)                                           | O(n)              |
| **Remove Middle**   | O(n)                                   | O(n)                                           | O(n)              |


